@@ -146,6 +147,19 @@ layer-rule {
 }
 ```
 
+#### `show-only-in`
+
+The opposite of `block-out-from`: the surface is drawn only to screencasts (`"screencast"`) or to all screen captures (`"screen-capture"`), never on the monitor itself.
+A shell can use it to cover the screen for viewers of a stream or a recording while you keep seeing your desktop.
+
+```kdl
+layer-rule {
+    match namespace="^privacy-curtain$"
+
+    show-only-in "screencast"
+}
+```
+
 #### `shadow`
 
